<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila Central Bank offers special 182-day bills.</title>
<headline>Manila Central Bank offers special 182-day bills.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philipine Central Bank said on Wednesday it was offering 182-day special series Treasury bills at 12.5 percent.</p>
<p>On Tuesday, the Central Bank did not offer special series T-bills.</p>
<p>The Bank had kept its overnight and term reverse repo rates unchanged.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
